{"about_the_game":"You got hired at <strong>Sorting Inc.</strong> the most renown company in town that specialized on one thing: sorting. While most people think it's a boring task that should be automated, the managers at Sorting Inc won't follow that trend. To become a true master at sorting you have to visit the different departments and learn all the techniques of an experienced sorter.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227640/extras/2b91b38b0b9dd57a4be5b33a7e883e66.poster.avif?t=1770386314\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227640/extras/2b91b38b0b9dd57a4be5b33a7e883e66.webm?t=1770386314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227640/extras/2b91b38b0b9dd57a4be5b33a7e883e66.mp4?t=1770386314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing Gameplay</h2>No time limits, no high scores, no pressure. Play at your own pace and free your mind while sorting items. It typically gets more fun the less you try to rush. It can however be quite satisfactory to optimize your sorting strategies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227640/extras/9fc4d4edc039594d521898fa66427761.poster.avif?t=1770386314\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227640/extras/9fc4d4edc039594d521898fa66427761.webm?t=1770386314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227640/extras/9fc4d4edc039594d521898fa66427761.mp4?t=1770386314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility</h2>Since some of the items are mainly distinguishable by color, different color palettes were added you can choose in the game options.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227640/extras/5ec7811c254f8e254e8ed76472810fd7.poster.avif?t=1770386314\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227640/extras/5ec7811c254f8e254e8ed76472810fd7.webm?t=1770386314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3227640/extras/5ec7811c254f8e254e8ed76472810fd7.mp4?t=1770386314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Cozy little game about sorting items according to several different properties<br></li><li>A variety of items to sort and organize<br></li><li>30 levels spread across 6 areas. Each area has it's own theme<br></li><li>Varying game modes and objectives<br></li><li>Unlockable skins for your working desk<br></li><li>Accompanied by a relaxing lo-fi soundtrack</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Day","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3227640/a1c3d2e95e2afb4ea3e68fbc60e1deddfa92190b.jpg"},{"name":"Confetti Rain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3227640/29aed70131bfc35f6beca985c6fa279df3fe072a.jpg"},{"name":"Rusty Business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3227640/af8bdf5962e9453f01a257983592ea2cc911dc16.jpg"},{"name":"Brick Genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3227640/ab87dba672ca6b3fe9a606087692ce4a8a090138.jpg"},{"name":"Enlightened","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3227640/743c08954ec6cf11d3b247fdb5206cdbc4174588.jpg"},{"name":"Finance Expert","path":"https://cdn.